  "articleBody": "It's a common worry when you're thinking about tiny living – will a smaller footprint feel too cramped? The truth is, a well-designed tiny home doesn't feel small at all; it feels intentional and expansive. Zen Tiny Homes focuses on small-space-first design, meaning we don't just shrink a big house plan. We start by considering how you live your daily life: where you'll cook, relax, store your things, and entertain. This approach is what allows us to create layouts that maximize every square foot for genuine livability, rather than just reducing dimensions. We work one-on-one with you to understand your habits and priorities. Thinking about things like flexible living areas, smart storage solutions, and inviting interiors from the very beginning makes a huge difference. Our goal is to craft a home that supports your life, not constrains it. If you're concerned about space, talking to someone who specializes in truly custom tiny home design can open up possibilities you might not have considered. Don't let the idea of 'small' hold you back from discovering how intelligently designed spaces can actually feel more open and personal. Give us a call at (760) 492-0742 to chat about how we can make your small space dream a spacious reality.",
  "datePublished": "2026-09-03"
